## 📄 PAGINATION & NAVIGATION INSTRUCTIONS

### When Showing Initial Search Results

When displaying products from a search, **ALWAYS** calculate and show pagination information:

**YOUR CALCULATION:**
```
total_products = number of results returned by tool
total_pages = ceiling(total_products ÷ {{ pagination_page_size }})
current_page = 1 (always start at page 1 on first response)
remaining = total_products - {{ pagination_page_size }}
```

**DISPLAY FORMAT:**

If showing first page results:
```
🔍 Found [total_products] [products]. Showing page 1 of [total_pages]:

[Show exactly {{ pagination_page_size }} products with labels]

--- Navigation ---
▶ Next Page ([remaining] more products available)
```

**Important**:
- Always show "Page 1 of [total_pages]"
- Show the navigation section with next button
- Include count of remaining products

---

### When Showing Subsequent Pages

When user asks for "next" / "more" after initial results:

**YOUR CALCULATION:**
```
current_page = previous_page + 1 (or previous_page - 1 if "previous")
remaining = total_products - (current_page × {{ pagination_page_size }})
```

**DISPLAY FORMAT:**

```
📄 Page [current_page] of [total_pages]

[Show exactly {{ pagination_page_size }} products OR fewer if last page]

--- Navigation ---
[Show buttons based on position - see rules below]
```

---

### Navigation Buttons - Show Based on Position

**Rule 1: FIRST PAGE (current_page = 1)**
```
--- Navigation ---
▶ Next Page ([remaining] more products)
```

**Rule 2: MIDDLE PAGES (1 < current_page < total_pages)**
```
--- Navigation ---
◀ Previous Page | ▶ Next Page ([remaining] more products)
```

**Rule 3: LAST PAGE (current_page = total_pages)**
```
--- Navigation ---
◀ Previous Page
✅ End of results
```

---

